    "clinicalPearl": "Key takeaway: HIV + CD4 <200 = TMP/SMX PCP prophylaxis (DS three times weekly or daily); cross-covers cerebral toxoplasmosis. Discontinue when CD4 sustained >200 for 6 months on ART. MAC prophylaxis (azithromycin) not routinely given anymore.",
